      },
      {
        "id": "restore",
        "description": "Restore Backup: put Claude Desktop's third-party files (claude_desktop_config.json, pluxy's gateway profile in configLibrary and configLibrary/_meta.json) back as they were before the first Apply (removing those that did not exist). Saving replaces the file; an edit made in the same instant by another program may be lost.",
